Manage saved dynamic Xray balancers

Usage: xrm group [OPTIONS] [SUBCOMMAND]

OPTIONS:
  -h,   --help            Show this help message 

SUBCOMMANDS:
  add                     Create a managed group with explicit node candidates 
  list                    List groups in a Profile 
  show                    Show one saved group 
  edit                    Replace one group from its complete JSON object 
  remove                  Remove a saved group 
  select                  Persist a manual group's chosen candidate 
  override                Temporarily override a running Xray balancer 
                          selection 

GLOBAL OPTIONS (before the command):
        --socket PATH     xrmd Unix domain socket 
        --json            Write machine readable output 
        --verbose         Include original diagnostics in human errors 

Examples:
  xrm group list Home

Next: xrm group <command> --help
